<title>JAPAN: Itochu Fuel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Itochu Fuel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		172.69		vs	  156.58</p>
<p> Operating	    2.06		vs	    2.21</p>
<p> Current		2.45		vs	    2.79</p>
<p> Net		    1.23		vs	    1.63</p>
<p> EPS		   11.24 yen	  vs	   16.09 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    109 million	  vs	 101 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Itochu Fuel Corp is a fuel dealer and affiliated with Itochu Corp.</p>
</text>
